    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Database conditions",
      "description": "Scoped through the mesh's cluster set, since a SlapdDatabase knows only its clusterRef and both refs resolve within one namespace.\n\nDataPresent with reason GlueSuffix is the ADR-025 failure: one pod's suffix entry demoted to a hidden glue entry, every CSN signal reading clean, backups from that pod unrestorable. It never heals itself, so its alert carries no `for` at all.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 85,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "insertNulls": false
          },
          "mappings": [
